mentation/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/deployments","created_at":"2019-09-25T20:19:14Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T08:36:37Z","pushed_at":"2026-03-09T08:36:33Z","git_url":"git://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","homepage":"https://opentelemetry.io","size":197176,"stargazers_count":2479,"watchers_count":2479,"language":"Java","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":1065,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":299,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":1065,"open_issues":299,"watchers":2479,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"### Describe the bug\n\nIn the Dubbo instrumentation, I identified a compatibility issue with context.getRemoteAddress() in Dubbo versions 3.0.x and 3.1.x. In these versions, [context.getRemoteAddress()](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/blob/7364927e510004356acd5d1f17c95daf17e16f89/instrumentation/apache-dubbo-2.7/library-autoconfigure/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/instrumentation/apachedubbo/v2_7/DubboRequest.java#L25) returns `null`, which prevents the correct value from being retrieved in other contexts. This is a bug in Dubbo; for more details, please refer to [issue](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/issues/11790).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nIn above versions of Dubbo, can't get expected remoteAddress by https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/blob/7364927e510004356acd5d1f17c95daf17e16f89/instrumentation/apache-dubbo-2.7/library-autoconfigure/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/instrumentation/apachedubbo/v2_7/DubboRequest.java#L36\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nIn above versions of Dubbo, return corrected remoteAddress by https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/blob/7364927e510004356acd5d1f17c95daf17e16f89/instrumentation/apache-dubbo-2.7/library-autoconfigure/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/instrumentation/apachedubbo/v2_7/DubboRequest.java#L36\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nIn above versions of Dubbo, return `null` by https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/blob/7364927e510004356acd5d1f17c95daf17e16f89/instrumentation/apache-dubbo-2.7/library-autoconfigure/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/instrumentation/apachedubbo/v2_7/DubboRequest.java#L36\n\n### Javaagent or library instrumentation version\n\n2.15.0\n\n### Environment\n\n_No response_\n\n### Additional context\n\n_No response_","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/issues/13786/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/issues/13786/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]